Correction to the commit message (appended; the note above is another session's and is untouched).

The message's line about Cargo.lock is wrong. Cargo.lock is not tracked in
this repo — ea9d3169 ("build: stop committing Cargo.lock — track latest
deps") removed it deliberately and .gitignore:10 keeps it out. The stated
advance of the genet.git pin from c36c34b to b9bc9269 was a local
working-copy effect and is not carried by this commit.

The illume fix still holds for other checkouts, but by a different mechanism
than the message describes: inker, nematic and knot-editor-host are branch
git deps, so a fresh checkout resolves genet.git main at its head and gets a
single illume regardless of any lockfile.

Everything else in the message — the Cargo.toml conflict resolution, the
graphshell source and manifest repair, and the cargo check --all-targets
verification across ten packages — is accurate and is carried by the commit.
